              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "एक मिनट (ek minaṭ) — \"one minute\", said the way English says \"a moment\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "English minute, borrowed, after the एक you count with."
            }
          ]
        },
