          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "एक मिनट (ek minaṭ) is ek, \"one\", from Sanskrit eka (CDIAL 2462), and minaṭ, English minute."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
